    "name": "JupyterHub REST Activity Tokens API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for JupyterHub, the multi-user server for Jupyter notebooks. Provides endpoints for managing users, groups, services, shared servers, OAuth2 authorization, the proxy, and the hub itself. JupyterHub spawns, manages, and proxies multiple instances of the single-user Jupyter notebook server.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Jupyter Project\n Email: jupyter@googlegroups.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
